{"completed": true, "response": "他还是能从和这个人自然相处中感受到真正的快乐。也正因为这段关系已经很珍贵，那份持续了一段时间、却一直没说出口的在意，才变得更加重要。他还是想和对方再亲近一些，但也一直知道，说出自己的心意可能会改变两人现在的相处。所以，他有时会突然很想说出来，却始终没有真的开口，也没有做出新的决定。他依然享受着现在的相处，但心里的顾虑也没有消失。他没有离开这段关系，也没有迈出那一步，既珍惜着现在拥有的，也在意着自己还没说出口的心意。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "74854d6b-e18b-4d1b-bc29-b97d745198ff", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003131940410Z", "elapsed_seconds": 7.562, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:31:39.505198+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d0c5d0c35fb0fb110188b7a84ca4e506d96f71fe011ac9727f5fbc8a0b519434", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003131940410Z", "files": ["pro